=== F. Resilience stress test on FY2026 base (INR crore) ===
A: revenue -20% and EBITDA margin -300bp: EBITDA 90,676.3 (-28,998.2); stressed CFO ~ 100,530.2 (EBITDA loss x (1 - 0.2517 tax shield)); stressed CFO - interest paid - lease principal - maintenance capex(base) = 47,688.2
   net debt/stressed EBITDA 1.04x; (net debt+leases)/stressed EBITDA 1.85x
B: revenue -20%, only access + licence costs flex (operating leverage): EBITDA 81,662.8 (-38,011.7); stressed CFO ~ 93,785.5 (EBITDA loss x (1 - 0.2517 tax shield)); stressed CFO - interest paid - lease principal - maintenance capex(base) = 40,943.5
   net debt/stressed EBITDA 1.15x; (net debt+leases)/stressed EBITDA 2.06x
Rate shock +200bp: floating-rate borrowings 15,952.1 -> +319.0/yr; plus refinancing of 12-month maturities 21,625.7 at +200bp -> +432.5; total ~ +751.6/yr = 1.4% of FY2026 equity FCF
Liquidity: cash 13,722.2 + current investments 13,700.6 + unrestricted other bank balances (approx.) 3,448.5 = 30,871.3 vs gross debt maturing in 24 months 35,936.1 (cover 0.86x)

